# KidBoard - root .env (optional, local development only).
# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored). Never commit real values.
#
# The worker's secrets belong in apps/worker/.dev.vars (see
# apps/worker/.dev.vars.example), not here. This file is only needed for
# tooling that reads the process environment, e.g. Playwright:
#
# Use a pre-installed Chromium instead of downloading browsers:
# PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE=/opt/pw-browsers/chromium
